<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Divine Space — जय बजरंगबली</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
body{
    margin:0;
    background:#000;
    color:white;
    font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
    overflow-x:hidden;
}

/* 🌌 Deep Universe Background */
body::before{
    content:'';
    position:fixed;
    top:0;left:0;
    width:100%;height:100%;
    background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, rgba(255,182,66,0.08), transparent 40%),
               radial-gradient(circle at 10% 80%, rgba(255,255,255,0.07), transparent 35%),
               radial-gradient(circle at 90% 30%, rgba(0,255,200,0.15), transparent 45%),
               #000;
    z-index:-3;
}

/* ✨ Infinite Stars */
.stars{
    position:fixed;
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    background:url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/stardust.png');
    opacity:0.35;
    animation: drift 45s linear infinite;
    z-index:-2;
}
@keyframes drift{
    from{transform:translateY(0);}
    to{transform:translateY(-1200px);}
}

/* 🎇 Divine Aura Glow Layer */
.aura{
    position:fixed;
    top:0;left:0;
    width:100%;height:100%;
    background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255,162,0,0.15), transparent 50%);
    filter:blur(20px);
    animation:pulse 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    z-index:-1;
}
@keyframes pulse{
    0%{opacity:0.3;}
    50%{opacity:0.7;}
    100%{opacity:0.3;}
}

/* Navbar */
nav{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    padding:20px 40px;
    background:rgba(10,10,10,0.75);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
}
nav h1{
    color:#ffae00;
}
nav a{
    color:#00ffee;
    text-decoration:none;
}

/* Hero Div */
.hero{
    text-align:center;
    padding:80px 20px 30px 20px;
}

/* Divine Title */
.hero h2{
    font-size:36px;
    color:#ffae00;
    letter-spacing:2px;
    text-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(255,174,0,0.9);
    animation:fadeIn 2s ease-in-out;
}
@keyframes fadeIn{
    from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);}
    to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
}

/* 🕉 Hanuman Divine Box */
.hanuman-container{
    position:relative;
    max-width:520px;
    margin:40px auto;
}

/* Holy Light Circle */
.light{
    position:absolute;
    top:50%;
    left:50%;
    width:380px;
    height:380px;
    transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
    background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,170,0,0.35), transparent 70%);
    border-radius:50%;
    filter:blur(20px);
    animation:breath 4s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes breath{
    0%{transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1);}
    50%{transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1.08);}
    100%{transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1);}
}

/* Image Box */
.hanuman-box{
    border-radius:20px;
    overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(255,150,0,0.7);
    animation:glow 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
}
@keyframes glow{
    from{box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(255,150,0,0.4);}
    to{box-shadow:0 0 75px rgba(255,150,0,1);}
}

.hanuman-box img{
    width:100%;
    display:block;
}

/* Mantra under image */
.mantra{
    color:#ffae00;
    letter-spacing:1px;
    text-shadow:0 0 15px rgba(255,180,0,0.8);
    animation:fadeIn 3s ease-in-out;
}

/* Section Title */
.section-title{
    color:#00ffee;
    text-align:center;
    margin-top:60px;
}

/* Cards */
.grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
    gap:20px;
    padding:20px;
    max-width:1100px;
    margin:auto;
}

.card{
    background:rgba(20,20,20,0.95);
    border-radius:18px;
    text-align:center;
    padding:25px;
    box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(0,255,200,0.3);
    transition:0.3s;
}
.card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-7px) scale(1.02);
    box-shadow:0 0 55px rgba(0,255,200,0.7);
}

footer{
    text-align:center;
    padding:30px;
    color:#777;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="stars"></div>
<div class="aura"></div>

<nav>
    <h1>🕉 Divine Presence</h1>
    <a href="/collections">← Back</a>
</nav>

<div class="hero">
    <h2>Enter the Sacred Universe</h2>
    <p>Close your eyes for a moment… feel the strength… feel the peace 🕉</p>

    <div class="hanuman-container">
        <div class="light"></div>

        <div class="hanuman-box">
            <img src="https://i.pinimg.com/736x/df/43/98/df4398136446ca1e6e4961b06d3d4582.jpg">
        </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="mantra">जय श्री राम | जय बजरंगबली</h3>
</div>

<h3 class="section-title">Your Spiritual Space</h3>

<div class="grid">

    <div class="card" onclick="window.location.href='/collections/devotion/god-photos'">
        📿<h3>God Photos</h3>
        <p>Divine images & sacred wallpapers</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" onclick="window.location.href='/collections/devotion/bhajans'">
        🎶<h3>Bhajans</h3>
        <p>Peaceful devotional songs</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" onclick="window.location.href='/collections/devotion/playlists'">
        🎧<h3>Playlists</h3>
        <p>Saved bhajan & mantra playlists</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" onclick="window.location.href='/collections/devotion/notes'">
        📜<h3>Spiritual Notes</h3>
        <p>Thoughts, learnings & quotes</p>
    </div>

</div>

<footer>
    Made with faith & devotion 🕉
</footer>

</body>
</html>
